# C: FromJson is strict by its plain name; FromJsonTolerant is the named twin

PORT TO THE STANDARD (Glenn 2026-10-18: \"We do all features across all languages.\"). The standard is docs/SPEC-TABLES.md and docs/USAGE.md as they stand on this base after the forward merge (c-base-takes-schema-go-d808c3f, which brings mas-bandwidth/schema sprint/schema-go at d808c3f54); schema-go's behaviour there is the oracle. This card is one feature of the C port and nothing else.

THE TASK. docs/SPEC-TABLES.md (read) §6.5 and §16.2: the plain FromJson (both shapes: the value read of a fixed-class root and the builder read of a variable root) refuses a text whose report holds a clamp, a kind mismatch, a malformed value or a duplicate the strict rule names, answering false, the value reset to its declared defaults, the supplied report overwritten with this read's report and its reason set. FromJsonTolerant keeps BASE's signature and answers. A builder already locked answers false before it reads, leaving the report empty. unknown keys stay skipped and counted (§16.2 at GO TIP) and do not refuse. Callers in test/c-tables/**,test/conformance/c/**,bench/tables/c/** that relied on the tolerant answer move to the Tolerant name. Files: internal/codegen/ctable/json.go,internal/codegen/ctable/graph_json.go, internal/tablenames/c.go, the generated trees.

THE ORACLE. schema-go at d808c3f54 is the answer key, and it is on this base after the forward merge: internal/codegen/gotable/strictdefault_test.go TestGoDefaultReadIsStrict (its FromJson rows) and internal/codegen/gotable/jsonlegacy_test.go (FromJsonTolerant keeps the old answers). Every expected answer the new test asserts is the one that Go test pins for the same schema text and the same input bytes, transcribed into the C probe with a comment citing the Go file and the case; never a value this port computed for itself. Read the Go emitter beside it (internal/codegen/gotable, named in the citation) for the rule's edges before writing the C one.

THE GAP AT BASE. grep -n 'FromJsonTolerant\\|from_json_tolerant' internal/codegen/ctable/json.go internal/codegen/ctable/graph_json.go prints nothing at BASE.

