# C# testgen: generated round-trip and damage tests per unit

`schema testgen` refuses every target but Go.

THE RULE. docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §16.11 (one generated test file per unit file that declares a root table, calling the generated API and the standard library only, deterministic to the byte). Oracle: internal/codegen/gotable/testgen.go and its tests at d808c3f54 (the same samples, built from the declaration alone).

THE GAP (read at BASE, after the forward merge). compiler/testgen_go.go at BASE: `target %q refuses testgen — Go carries the generated round-trip and damage tests first`.

