STEP 3. Make it pass in the files PATHS names, citing the section of docs/SPEC-TABLES.md from each function that implements a rule.
STEP 4. Run the gate: go test -count=1 -timeout 600s ./internal/codegen/darttable/ ./compiler/ ./internal/ci/ and read the last line of each. When a test fails, name its file and say whether your work changed it or it is red at BASE, and report that line first.
