STEP 2. Red first: write the test against the strict names and run it at BASE: the clamped row answers {:ok, ...}; keep the failing line.
STEP 3. Make load/2 and from_json/2 strict, add the _tolerant twins and the report's reason, move the tolerant callers, regenerate the committed Elixir.
