STEP 4. Make it pass in the files PATHS names, and only those.
STEP 5. Run the gate: the commands DONE-WHEN names, and read the last line of each. When a test fails, name its file and say whether that file was changed by your work (yours) or is unchanged (already red at BASE: run the same test on the unchanged base to say so), and report that line first.
