THE GAP AT BASE. At BASE (after the forward merge) compiler/testgen_go.go refuses every target but go.

THE TASK. Emit Java tests (JUnit-free: a main that exits non-zero) from the declaration in the shape Go's Testgen writes (internal/codegen/javatable/testgen.go), expose them as compiler.TestgenJava in the new compiler/testgen_java.go, and dispatch the java target to it from cmd/schema/main.go (its c.Testgen call near line 342 after the forward merge). compiler/testgen_go.go (read), which arrives with the forward merge and refuses every target but go, is left unchanged; if a single dispatcher there is the cleaner shape, put that diff in the report as a proposed diff. docs/CLI.md (read) also arrives with the forward merge and is not on this card's PATHS (the lint reads the pre-merge base): write its one-line usage change (the testgen target list) into the pull request body as a proposed diff.

