# JavaScript carries the optional map `?map[K]V`: absent, present-empty and present-with-entries are three values

THE RULE. docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §2.8 read through §2.3: `tags ?map[string(8)]int32` carries a presence companion; ABSENT writes nothing, PRESENT-EMPTY writes the field header and the two-byte body `0d 00` under L = 2, present-with-entries is the plain map's bytes; JSON absent omits the key, present-empty is `{}`, `null` reads absent; retain-unknown and the cooked form keep the presence; the view names the field optional; a reader built without the `?` reads the three wires silently as the plain map. Oracle: internal/codegen/gotable/mappresence_test.go TestGoMapPresence.

