THE TASK. Read the declaration in jstable.GenerateLineage and each emitter, emitting exactly the forms named (the JS module set per table), refusing by Go's names what Go refuses.

THE TESTS. TestJsFormsDeclaration (new): for each forms list the oracle's Go tests use, the set of exported JS names per table matches the set of Go functions per table form for form (a table without json has no ToJson/FromJson in either), and the refusals match. Red at BASE.

