# `schema testgen --lang js` writes each root table's round-trip and damage tests

THE RULE. docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §16.11 \"Generated round-trip and damage tests: `schema testgen`\": one test file per unit file declaring a root table, using the generated API and the language's standard library only, a value through the binary, base64 and JSON carriers and back, and a damaged input refused by name; a table whose forms leave out wire or json is refused by name. Oracle: internal/codegen/gotable/testgen.go and its tests.

