DONE-WHEN: TestRustTableStringArrays RUN and PASS, none SKIP; go test ./compiler/ green (its refusal test updated); make test-rust and make conformance green or reds named as present at BASE; make roadmap-check clean. Red at BASE: TestRustTableStringArrays does not exist (`go test -run TestRustTableStringArrays` reports no tests to run), and in the merged view compiler/generate.go (read) refuses text lists for rust (refuseTextForms), so `go run ./cmd/schema generate --lang rust` on the oracle's schema answers that refusal.

