DONE-WHEN: TestRustTextListTotalBytesBound RUN and PASS, none SKIP; go test ./compiler/ green (its refusal test updated); make test-rust and make conformance green or reds named as present at BASE; make roadmap-check clean. Red at BASE: TestRustTextListTotalBytesBound does not exist (`go test -run TestRustTextListTotalBytesBound` reports no tests to run), and in the merged view compiler/generate.go (read) refuses a text list total for rust (the text list total refusal (TestListTotalBytesRefusedOffGo)), so `go run ./cmd/schema generate --lang rust` on the oracle's schema answers that refusal.

