STEP 4. Run the gate: the go test lines of DONE-WHEN, then go test -count=1 -timeout 600s on the other packages DONE-WHEN names, and read the last line of each. When a test fails, name its file and say whether that file was changed by your work (yours) or is unchanged (already red at BASE: run the same test on the unchanged base to say so), and report that line first.
