Unit tests use no real time, no sockets, no network and no outside services: time is an argument and a test clock starts at 1000.0. Anything that runs the port toolchain is the functional tier and skips by name without it, as its neighbours do.
Make the smallest change that does the task, with no refactor beyond what the task names. Never read outside the job working directory; never search /, ~ or /Volumes.
